{"id":"b1e40007c424ab26","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-game4-best-reply-correspondence.md","title":"ZFC Game4 Best Reply Correspondence","display":"df-zfc-game4-best-reply-correspondence — ZFC Game4 Best Reply Correspondence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game4-best-reply-correspondence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game4-best-reply-correspondence"],"display":"df-zfc-game4-best-reply-correspondence — ZFC Game4 Best Reply Correspondence","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game4-best-reply-correspondence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game4-best-reply-correspondence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game4-best-reply-correspondence — ZFC Game4 Best Reply Correspondence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,\\vec S,\\vec u\\in V\">\\(N,\\vec S,\\vec u\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\ne\\emptyset\">\\(N\\ne\\emptyset\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\\)</span> with every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec S(j)\">\\(\\vec S(j)\\)</span> nonempty, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec u,N,\\mathbb R^{\\prod_{j\\in N}\\vec S(j)})\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec u,N,\\mathbb R^{\\prod_{j\\in N}\\vec S(j)})\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in N\">\\(i\\in N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_{-i}\\in\\prod_{j\\in N\\setminus\\{i\\}}\\vec S(j)\">\\(s_{-i}\\in\\prod_{j\\in N\\setminus\\{i\\}}\\vec S(j)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_{-i}[i\\mapsto a]\">\\(s_{-i}[i\\mapsto a]\\)</span> denotes the full profile extending <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_{-i}\">\\(s_{-i}\\)</span> by action <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> at coordinate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_i\\subseteq S_i\">\\(B_i\\subseteq S_i\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> is the set-function predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4BestReplyCorrespondence}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4BestReplyCorrespondence}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}best\\text{-}reply\\text{-}correspondence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4BestReplyCorrespondence}_S(N,\\vec S,\\vec u,i,s_{-i},B_i)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nN\\ne\\emptyset\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\n\\land\\forall j\\in N\\;(\\vec S(j)\\ne\\emptyset)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\vec u,N,\\mathbb R^{\\prod_{j\\in N}\\vec S(j)}\\right)\n\\land i\\in N\n\\land s_{-i}\\in\\prod_{j\\in N\\setminus\\{i\\}}\\vec S(j)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land B_i=\\left\\{a\\in\\vec S(i):\\forall b\\in\\vec S(i)\\;\\bigl(\n\\vec u(i)(s_{-i}[i\\mapsto a])\\geq\\vec u(i)(s_{-i}[i\\mapsto b])\\bigr)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}best\\text{-}reply\\text{-}correspondence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4BestReplyCorrespondence}_S(N,\\vec S,\\vec u,i,s_{-i},B_i)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nN\\ne\\emptyset\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\n\\land\\forall j\\in N\\;(\\vec S(j)\\ne\\emptyset)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\vec u,N,\\mathbb R^{\\prod_{j\\in N}\\vec S(j)}\\right)\n\\land i\\in N\n\\land s_{-i}\\in\\prod_{j\\in N\\setminus\\{i\\}}\\vec S(j)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land B_i=\\left\\{a\\in\\vec S(i):\\forall b\\in\\vec S(i)\\;\\bigl(\n\\vec u(i)(s_{-i}[i\\mapsto a])\\geq\\vec u(i)(s_{-i}[i\\mapsto b])\\bigr)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Strategy sets and payoff functions are set-coded families. The payoff is evaluated on an explicitly reconstructed full profile, eliminating the informal expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_i(s_i,s_{-i})\">\\(u_i(s_i,s_{-i})\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ is the set-function predicate from [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"N,\\vec S,\\vec u\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"N\\ne\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec S(j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec u,N,\\mathbb R^{\\prod_{j\\in N}\\vec S(j)})","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in N","display":false},{"tex":"s_{-i}\\in\\prod_{j\\in N\\setminus\\{i\\}}\\vec S(j)","display":false},{"tex":"s_{-i}[i\\mapsto a]","display":false},{"tex":"s_{-i}","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"B_i\\subseteq S_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4BestReplyCorrespondence}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}best\\text{-}reply\\text{-}correspondence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4BestReplyCorrespondence}_S(N,\\vec S,\\vec u,i,s_{-i},B_i)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nN\\ne\\emptyset\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\n\\land\\forall j\\in N\\;(\\vec S(j)\\ne\\emptyset)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\vec u,N,\\mathbb R^{\\prod_{j\\in N}\\vec S(j)}\\right)\n\\land i\\in N\n\\land s_{-i}\\in\\prod_{j\\in N\\setminus\\{i\\}}\\vec S(j)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land B_i=\\left\\{a\\in\\vec S(i):\\forall b\\in\\vec S(i)\\;\\bigl(\n\\vec u(i)(s_{-i}[i\\mapsto a])\\geq\\vec u(i)(s_{-i}[i\\mapsto b])\\bigr)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"u_i(s_i,s_{-i})","display":false}],"bytes":1873,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-219